.agent-output/

# Vendored upstream comparator clones — full trees are large (datasets,
# .git internals, model checkpoints) and reproducible from each vendor's
# pinned COMMIT.txt SHA. We track only the audit trail (COMMIT.txt + any
# patches we apply) and a top-level README. Rehydrate with the recipe in
# comparators/README.md.
comparators/**
!comparators/README.md
!comparators/*/
!comparators/*/COMMIT.txt
!comparators/*/PATCH-NOTES.md
